Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:08.98,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Be extra careful if you're type B.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:14.74,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}If you leave untreated, it can get worse and even be life threatening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:18.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Turn it off! I don't like this kind of TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:24.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not that scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You should go and bathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:31.76,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will I die too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:32.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:37.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're only 6 years old. What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:44.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:26.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:36.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't going to work if I can't find a proper daycare soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:42.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I hear some big companies have facilities to look after children.{Note: 託児所 takujishou is yet another term for daycare}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:46.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, what country is {\i1}that{\i0}?{Where in the country would I find something like that?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.58,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:54.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:02:59.34,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Did you manage to get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:00.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.21,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Recently, you've been leaving especially early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:03.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:06.89,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you always take the last train home?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:10.90,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You even got this year's sales record!{He says "Kyonen", which means "This year". Please insert it into the line appropriately. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:12.03,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,If this carries on...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.03,0:03:16.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Those figures aren't something that can be accomplished through momentum and willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:18.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm only lucky, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:20.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My name {\i1}is{\i0} Daikichi after all. {大吉 Daikichi means excellent luck}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:20.30,Note,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Note: (大吉) Daikichi means "excellent luck."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.34,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:24.11,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:27.29,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:28.70,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The fourth floor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:32.35,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. You still doing well?{I hate this line.-AE}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:33.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's completely hopeless this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:36.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even this guy is giving me stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:38.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I might start going bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:41.82,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough once you leave down good results.{"Leave behind"? please check. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:47.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Gotou-san, do you really have children?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:49.68,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Could you not judge by the height?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:53.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're so small; I don't know how a kid could fit in there.{Go go gadget sexual harrasment lawsuit!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.71,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Even I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:57.88,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He's already two years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:00.99,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, over there please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:02.96,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I'll go with you. {Added the "Ah", please remove if it doesn't fit or anything, will retime it then. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:04.74,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,No need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:06.18,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:08.01,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:12.24,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Still powerful as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:15.52,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be great if Gotou-san were still in Sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.37,0:04:18.98,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's older then me by a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:24.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,After her pregnancy, she stepped down so she could get home earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:29.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There were lots of rumours in the company about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:32.84,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.76,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,How long will you be taking care of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:37.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:39.46,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:42.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's been frequently wetting her bed recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:45.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I noticed she seems pretty embarrassed about it.{SHE'S embarrassed. HE'S concerned.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:48.55,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It could be psychological.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:51.84,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,But you know, small kids sweat quite a surprising amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:54.21,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Though they'll sweat less in fall and winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.05,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,So they'll have to go to the bathroom more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:05:01.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my mom used to tell me to visit the toilet before I went to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:05.40,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother must really be worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:08.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't get a chance to ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:11.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like mothers are really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:13.63,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,A grown man shouldn't be saying such depressing stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.66,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:18.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What did you play today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:23.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Looked at picture books, and made silly faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:28.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Was it fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:29.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:32.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:35.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll prepare dinner right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:42.07,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The moon is shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:55.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:57.08,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,So how's it going? Doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:59.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:01.44,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not asking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:03.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, she's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:04.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, what's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:07.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you didn't want to get yourself into trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:10.96,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,I can't just do nothing, since she's staying at your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:18.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming over this weekend to search for clues about Rin's mother.{I'm going to search for clues regarding Rin's mother this weekend.} {Added the "over there", it basically means his parents' house/Grandpa's house, which seem close to each other/might be same. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:19.48,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:22.30,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a call once you reach the bus stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:24.63,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure she wears extra layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:27.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. I'll call Haruko to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:30.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin seems to get along well with her kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:35.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it went past another car! {I also love seeing that, even in my age :3 -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You look happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:40.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:45.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:49.25,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:51.05,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,So you're here, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.00,0:06:53.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:06:59.82,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:03.17,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing here that little children will enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:06.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She prefers the sort of stuff that adults eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:08.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:10.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.05,0:07:10.82,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:13.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if you get hungry later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.47,0:07:15.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can't eat any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:19.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for having leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:24.21,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back! Sorry I'm late! {Hurr! Here comes the hot headed imouto :D -sm}{She says "I'm late." or something like that. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.67,0:07:30.56,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,They are the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:33.04,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that annoying woman and her kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:38.85,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan! You really took her home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:42.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:46.53,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}The weather report next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:50.23,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Today, the entire country will experience warm weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:53.92,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}The surrounding temperatures have increased by 2 degrees...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:55.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm only going to the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:55.79,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}...compared to previous years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:58.33,Default,TV,0000,0000,0000,,Next up will be the weather for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.61,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I said I'm going to the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go with you there.{Nice sense of humor :D -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.72,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Is she normally like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.55,0:08:23.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, she's pretty talkative at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:27.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She also seemed to be having fun on the train, as though she's going on a holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:32.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But the moment she came, she saw the strict aunties and uncles who were at the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.45,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What did we do wrong!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:37.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:42.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When adults are in a bad mood, the kids will feel it's their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:46.43,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Children are indeed like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.43,0:08:49.09,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Both of you probably used to be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:53.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Look! Even a thick-headed person like you felt this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:55.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is definitely more intelligent than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:56.80,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, baldhead! {Ouch. But they're on good terms. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:08.77,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you like Cat's Cradle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:13.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, at least give a reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:14.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:17.45,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,This is for Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:24.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:28.79,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Aunty will show you how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:30.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"Aunty", you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:32.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Shouldn't it be "Granny" instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:35.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You don't look like a granny at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:38.34,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, what a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:41.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess this kid's idea of "old" is much older than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.55,0:09:43.02,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Okay now, watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:49.15,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Oh dear, did I do it wrongly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:52.98,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:56.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This? The 4-step-ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.66,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The 2-step-ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.49,0:10:03.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Air plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:05.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:09.19,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:13.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The strings are easy to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make these yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:17.74,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I knitted them using some fine wool thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:21.39,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Compared to using pure wool threads, the weight is just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:23.04,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:26.35,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Since you have such articulate hands, you should be able to handle beanbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:30.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Use your little finger and hook it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:31.64,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:32.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:40.32,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,One bean bag~ two bean bags{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:42.12,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:44.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind, we should be asking you why you're dressed like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:46.91,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!{It actually says, "Hai!" please change. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:48.04,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:49.63,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably Haruko-san with her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:52.13,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! {Ah, she's here again. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:54.54,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's beautiful, what are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:56.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They are called bean bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:10:59.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.25,0:11:00.32,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:04.18,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,But working and raising her at the same time, you're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:08.58,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,The one at my place doesn't help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.60,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to Grandpa's place later?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:15.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I want to see if there are any leads about Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:16.07,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:18.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's easy to manipulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:20.14,Default-Alt,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}I think mothers are really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:22.10,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You do this and then that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.78,0:12:13.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:16.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, you should have written a Will before you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:19.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you worried about Rin? {Aren't}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:31.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Modem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:35.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:39.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's with that hairstyle of yours?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:43.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I tied it to be the same as Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:45.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And what's with the clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.81,0:12:47.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're Kazumi Onee-chan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:49.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.27,0:12:50.77,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:53.79,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Such old-fashioned stuff won't suit modern kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:57.21,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Look! It really does suit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:01.17,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:05.09,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Modern kids with this body style, in old clothes, feels pretty fashionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:07.64,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,How nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.64,Default-Alt,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Did you find any clues at Grandpa's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,None at all. I couldn't find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:12.14,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:16.51,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what, I think it's best you don't rush yourself to ask her about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:17.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:20.52,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,You're doing your best.{Does he not say "You're doing your best?" -sm}{present tense sounds better.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:21.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.67,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I haven't told you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.67,0:13:27.14,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother was actually still working after you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:30.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She wasn't a full time housewife all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:35.91,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,When she was pregnant with Kazumi, she was hospitalised for a while after overworking herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:40.78,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,She realised her position was gone after returning to her company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:44.56,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother was really upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:47.38,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Kazumi was still very small after birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:52.85,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,She always had to take days off or leave early to look after you two.{He said "the children", but he's talking to one of the subjects, this maskes more sense.}{He sounds like one of those dolls that pretents to cry}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:55.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:14:02.69,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Because she gave up everything for Kazumi, she grew up so unreasonable and spoiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:07.28,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:08.93,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want your dad to send you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:11.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. We'll make it there by foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:20.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I still come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:25.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She asks if she can visit again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:31.78,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Aunty will be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:34.10,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,You can come any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:35.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:44.08,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What are you saying!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:46.37,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it nice to have a grandchild?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:48.25,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,You can leave the child to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:51.03,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's impossible to raise a kid and work at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:53.24,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,The women will surely be on the losing end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:56.88,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I still want to wear a swimsuit, or go out drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:04.21,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Rin, did Grandpa own a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.21,0:15:06.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You know what a computer is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:07.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:09.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then, did Grandpa use one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:11.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The assistant is the one who used the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:13.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There was an assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:16.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The assistant, Masako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:22.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What kind of person was she?{He says "datta", so "was". Please check tense consistency for these last few lines -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:26.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.45,0:15:45.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like Masako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:50.01,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Because she hates me and always gets angry at me. {Please check if tense is all right here. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:53.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She's very scary, so I forgot about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:15:58.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:05.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It might be too late to say this now, but working while raising a child at the same time is really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.19,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. You were clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:17.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Have you ever felt like you're sacrificing yourself for your child?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:19.08,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Are you referring to my job transfer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:22.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I guess it was rude to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:26.24,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I felt this was the best choice at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:28.74,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It turned out fine, so it's all right I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.63,0:16:38.18,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I really felt that way, I'd never say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:41.10,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Because the power of words is very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.02,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I believe it's called the Power of Language. {Note: 言霊 kotodama = power of language}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:45.33,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Is it a bit too abstract?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:49.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No. Amazingly, I understand it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.22,0:16:52.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm counting on you to teach me more kid related stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:56.80,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Your kid is even older, Kawachi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:17:00.24,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I actually want some advice from you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:29.98,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, it's all right for you to wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:31.90,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But it's just sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if it's sweat or anything; it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:40.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have a nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.09,0:17:45.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What is it like to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:48.88,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, will you die before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The misery of Grandpa's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:55.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her anxiety of what happens if I were to die too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:17:59.80,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coupled with her fear of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:04.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's become a mess because she's unable to sort them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:09.84,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine until you grow up to be a big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:13.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,When will I become a big sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:17.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'll still be fine even until you become an aunty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:20.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Before all that happens, I will never die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:29.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wetting the bed is no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:31.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine if you visit the toilet before sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:33.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm afraid of the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:35.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll accompany you at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:40.17,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If you still wet the bed, you just have to change your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:43.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will you be angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:47.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to be angry about, or laugh about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:54.90,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,What did you want to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:57.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pardon me for being so sudden, Hidaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:19:00.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It might sound a bit sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:04.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please transfer me to a section without overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.63,0:19:07.75,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,What? Kawachi! Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:10.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm dead serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:14.36,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,I see, something like that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:16.92,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,I personally feel it's a pity. {a huge loss}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:19.60,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,But, I have children of my own, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:23.04,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best to speak to the chief about your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:24.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:26.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:30.15,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,But those people below will start making a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.15,0:19:31.85,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I won't accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:33.86,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Why must it be Kawachi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:36.34,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you just ask your relatives for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:38.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I can tell him that I decided to raise her at the spur of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:43.27,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't the daycare stay open late?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:46.28,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to be under anyone besides you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:49.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I admit that it may be too sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.22,0:19:53.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Superiors transferring suddenly is something pretty common.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:54.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be so stubborn about it. {mindful}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:20:00.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm still really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.77,0:20:07.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even without me around, my section will eventually return to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Either that or the whole company fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:13.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But Rin doesn't work like that, that's what I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:18.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My thinking should be correct, probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:21.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:23.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, is this much rich enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:24.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, just nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.41,0:20:29.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Towel, lunch box, indoor slippers, toothbrush, cup and names are already written.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.81,0:20:32.33,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Futon!? Only the infants need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:33.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:40.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.79,0:20:48.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, I'd be lying if I said this wasn't a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:53.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But as long as I don't regret this while looking back a few years down the road, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.79,0:22:26.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:29.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That picture you have on the hand towel and lunch box... {手拭き tefuki = hand towel}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.63,0:22:30.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.03,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like some sort of big-eared dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.03,0:22:35.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.61,0:22:38.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a Lop Ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.41,0:22:40.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Lop{\fscx300}-{\fscx100} what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:41.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Rabbit! {bunny} {I vote for "bunny", since it seems more likely to be a term a 6-year old child will use. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.44,0:22:44.21,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? Isn't this a spotted dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.21,0:22:45.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:47.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:56.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go take a piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.13,0:22:58.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I already went.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:22:59.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:54.95,Credits,,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(291,168)}Oyatsu Fansubs Presents
