Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:58.07,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,ashita no koto ha wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:58.07,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,明日のことは　分かんない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:58.07,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know what's going to happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:01:03.20,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,korette gisei toha chigau nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:01:03.20,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,これって　犠牲とは違う　何かが違う
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:01:03.20,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,This is different from sacrificing, very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:06.92,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,batsugeemu jaa nante omou wa nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:06.92,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,罰ゲームじゃあ　なんて思うわない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:06.92,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think this is a punishment game either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:10.09,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,tte nande nanoka ha wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:10.09,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,って　なんでなのかは　分かんない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:10.09,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't really say well what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:13.34,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:13.34,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,ちょっと　釈然としないけど　
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:13.34,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, I do feel quite troubled,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:19.51,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nantemonjanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:19.51,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,キミの存在　今大事だ　なんてもんじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:19.51,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,but "important" cannot be used to describe your existence any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:25.64,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,owaranai koto nante konoyo no dokonimonai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:25.64,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,終わらないことなんて　この世のどこにもない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:25.64,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing that will last forever without coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:29.86,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,naku no ha tsurai janai no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:29.86,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,泣くのは辛いじゃないの　
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:29.86,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Crying is a very painful thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:32.48,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,I know! Sweet drops! Sweet drops!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:35.99,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,zutto yume mite itaine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:35.99,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,ずっと　夢見ていたいね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:35.99,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I have always wanted to dream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:39.28,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,motto yasashiku shitaine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:39.28,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,もっと　優しくしたいね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:39.28,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,To be able to be more gentle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:42.83,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,kimi to iraretara happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:42.83,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,キミと居られたら　happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:42.83,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Just being together with you is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:46.25,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,onnanoko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:46.25,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,女の子って　強いね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:46.25,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Girls are strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:49.54,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:49.54,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,だけど　時々　弱いね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:49.54,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,but at times, they are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:56.13,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\t(399,2068,\3c&HD8A561&)}bokura no negai ha happy! happy! happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:56.13,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\t(399,2068,\3c&HD8A561&)\pos(640,95)}僕らの願いは　happy! happy! happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:56.13,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\t(399,2068,\3c&HD8A561&)}Our wish is to be happy! Happy! Happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:02:00.09,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\3c&HD8A561&\t(284,1660,\3c&HCB2A71&)\t(2786,3120,\3c&H8C1FA4&)}sonna hibi mo happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:02:00.09,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\3c&HD8A561&\pos(640,95)\t(284,1660,\3c&HCB2A71&)\t(2786,3120,\3c&H8C1FA4&)}そんな日々も happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:02:00.09,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\3c&HD8A561&\t(284,1660,\3c&HCB2A71&)\t(2786,3120,\3c&H8C1FA4&)}Such happy days!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:07.35,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\3c&H51CDDD&\t(0,1293,\3c&H44EFB5&)}Just wanna make you happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:05.95,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,nichiyou no hare ta hiru sagari
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:05.95,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,日曜の晴れた昼さがり
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:05.95,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,On a clear Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:10.29,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}kyou ha doko he yukou
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:10.29,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}今日はどこへ行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:10.29,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}Where are we heading today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:20.67,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:20.67,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}通い慣れたいつもの道が眩しく輝いて見える
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:20.67,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}The usual road that we always take seems to be shining radiantly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:30.64,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,terasu atatakai taiyou to tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:30.64,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,照らす暖かい太陽と　隣に君がいれば　
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:30.64,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,The warm sun shining with you still by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:35.19,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:35.19,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,もう　High　High　High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:35.19,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,We're already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:40.94,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:40.94,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,はしゃぎだす気持ちに
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:40.94,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Feeling merry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:45.86,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:45.86,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,歌え　Life　Life　Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:45.86,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Sing life, life, life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:51.24,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,koe ha dokomade mo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:51.24,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,声はどこまでも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:51.24,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,I can hear our voices anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:56.29,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:56.29,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,もう　High　High　High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:56.29,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,We're already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:22:01.80,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:22:01.80,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,舞い上がる風に乗り
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:22:01.80,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Riding on the soaring wind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:06.67,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:06.67,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,歌え　Life　Life　Life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:06.67,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Sing life, life, life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:15.31,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:15.31,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,声も飛び跳ねる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:15.31,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Our voices are hopping too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
